      "writtenOn": "2022-05-12T00:42:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The cancellation happened after bonding completed, not before paing. Besides, there is already a queue in libbluetooth (see http://go/floss-br-hid-connection) and the 1st solution seems complicate the problem.",
      "parentUuid": "461e17eb_5d6896ea",
